rse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:8.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:8.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja477:9.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:9.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja477:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja477:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja477:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja477:13.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:13.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:13.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:13.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja477:14.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:14.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:14.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja477:14.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja477:15.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja477:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja477:0.2": "Terasakanipāta ", "ja477:0.3": "Ambavagga ", "ja477:0.4": "4. Cūḷanāradajātaka ", "ja477:1.1": "“Na te kaṭṭhāni bhinnāni, ", "ja477:1.2": "na te udakamābhataṁ; ", "ja477:1.3": "Aggīpi te na hāpito, ", "ja477:1.4": "kiṁ nu mandova jhāyasi”. ", "ja477:2.1": "“Na ussahe vane vatthuṁ, ", "ja477:2.2": "kassapāmantayāmi taṁ; ", "ja477:2.3": "Dukkho vāso araññasmiṁ, ", "ja477:2.4": "raṭṭhaṁ icchāmi gantave. ", "ja477:3.1": "Yathā ahaṁ ito gantvā, ", "ja477:3.2": "Yasmiṁ janapade vasaṁ; ", "ja477:3.3": "Ācāraṁ brahme sikkheyyaṁ, ", "ja477:3.4": "Taṁ dhammaṁ anusāsa maṁ”. ", "ja477:4.1": "“Sace araññaṁ hitvāna, ", "ja477:4.2": "vanamūlaphalāni ca; ", "ja477:4.3": "Raṭṭhe rocayase vāsaṁ, ", "ja477:4.4": "taṁ dhammaṁ nisāmehi me. ", "ja477:5.1": "Visaṁ mā paṭisevittho, ", "ja477:5.2": "papātaṁ parivajjaya; ", "ja477:5.3": "Paṅke ca mā visīdittho, ", "ja477:5.4": "yatto cāsīvise care”. ", "ja477:6.1": "“Kiṁ nu visaṁ papāto vā, ", "ja477:6.2": "paṅko vā brahmacārinaṁ; ", "ja477:6.3": "Kaṁ tvaṁ āsīvisaṁ brūsi, ", "ja477:6.4": "taṁ me akkhāhi pucchito”. ", "ja477:7.1": "“Āsavo tāta lokasmiṁ, ", "ja477:7.2": "surā nāma pavuccati; ", "ja477:7.3": "Manuñño surabhī vaggu, ", "ja477:7.4": "sādu khuddarasūpamo; ", "ja477:7.5": "Visaṁ tadāhu ariyā se, ", "ja477:7.6": "brahmacariyassa nārada. ", "ja477:8.1": "Itthiyo tāta lokasmiṁ, ", "ja477:8.2": "pamattaṁ pamathenti tā; ", "ja477:8.3": "Haranti yuvino cittaṁ, ", "ja477:8.4": "tūlaṁ bhaṭṭhaṁva māluto; ", "ja477:8.5": "Papāto eso akkhāto, ", "ja477:8.6": "brahmacariyassa nārada. ", "ja477:9.1": "Lābho siloko sakkāro, ", "ja477:9.2": "pūjā parakulesu ca; ", "ja477:9.3": "Paṅko eso ca akkhāto, ", "ja477:9.4": "brahmacariyassa nārada. ", "ja477:10.1": "Sasatthā tāta rājāno, ", "ja477:10.2": "āvasanti mahiṁ imaṁ; ", "ja477:10.3": "Te tādise manussinde, ", "ja477:10.4": "mahante tāta nārada. ", "ja477:11.1": "Issarānaṁ adhipatīnaṁ, ", "ja477:11.2": "na tesaṁ pādato care; ", "ja477:11.3": "Āsīvisoti akkhāto, ", "ja477:11.4": "brahmacariyassa nārada. ", "ja477:12.1": "Bhattattho bhattakāle ca, ", "ja477:12.2": "yaṁ gehamupasaṅkame; ", "ja477:12.3": "Yadettha kusalaṁ jaññā, ", "ja477:12.4": "tattha ghāsesanaṁ care. ", "ja477:13.1": "Pavisitvā parakulaṁ, ", "ja477:13.2": "pānatthaṁ bhojanāya vā; ", "ja477:13.3": "Mitaṁ khāde mitaṁ bhuñje, ", "ja477:13.4": "na ca rūpe manaṁ kare. ", "ja477:14.1": "Goṭṭhaṁ majjaṁ kirāṭañca, ", "ja477:14.2": "sabhā nikiraṇāni ca; ", "ja477:14.3": "Ārakā parivajjehi, ", "ja477:14.4": "yānīva visamaṁ pathan”ti. ", "ja477:15.1": "Cūḷanāradajātakaṁ catutthaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja477:0.1": "", "ja477:0.2": "", "ja477:0.3": "", "ja477:0.4": "", "ja477:1.1": "", "ja477:1.2": "", "ja477:1.3": "hāpito → hāsito (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja477:1.4": "", "ja477:2.1": "", "ja477:2.2": "", "ja477:2.3": "", "ja477:2.4": "", "ja477:3.1": "", "ja477:3.2": "", "ja477:3.3": "brahme → brahmaṁ (mr) ", "ja477:3.4": "", "ja477:4.1": "", "ja477:4.2": "ca → eso (bj); esova (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja477:4.3": "ca → yaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja477:4.4": "", "ja477:5.1": "paṭisevittho → patisevittho (bj, pts-vp-pli1); paṭisevittha (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja477:5.2": "", "ja477:5.3": "Paṅke ca mā visīdittho → paṅko ca mā visiyittho (mr) ", "ja477:5.4": "", "ja477:6.1": "", "ja477:6.2": "", "ja477:6.3": "", "ja477:6.4": "", "ja477:7.1": "", "ja477:7.2": "", "ja477:7.3": "Manuñño → manuññā (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja477:7.4": "sādu → madhu (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed) | khuddarasūpamo → … rasūpamā (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja477:7.5": "", "ja477:7.6": "", "ja477:8.1": "", "ja477:8.2": "", "ja477:8.3": "", "ja477:8.4": "", "ja477:8.5": "", "ja477:8.6": "", "ja477:9.1": "", "ja477:9.2": "", "ja477:9.3": "", "ja477:9.4": "", "ja477:10.1": "Sasatthā → mahantā (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja477:10.2": "", "ja477:10.3": "", "ja477:10.4": "", "ja477:11.1": "", "ja477:11.2": "", "ja477:11.3": "Āsīvisoti → āsīviso so (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja477:11.4": "", "ja477:12.1": "", "ja477:12.2": "", "ja477:12.3": "", "ja477:12.4": "", "ja477:13.1": "", "ja477:13.2": "pānatthaṁ → pānattho (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja477:13.3": "", "ja477:13.4": "", "ja477:14.1": "kirāṭañca → kirāsañca (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed); kirāsaṁ vā (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja477:14.2": "", "ja477:14.3": "", "ja477:14.4": "", "ja477:15.1": "Cūḷanāradajātakaṁ → cullanāradajātakaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1); cullanāradakassapajātakaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) "}, "reference_text": {"ja477:0.1": "", "ja477:0.